      "This is not a pure pass-through of fields, such as this implementation in python: [csingley/ofxtools](https://github.com/csingley/ofxtools). This package contains fields that have been \"translated\" on occasion to make it more friendly to those less-familiar wi",
      "This is a fork of [grimfor/ofxparser](https://github.com/Grimfor/ofxparser) made to be framework independent. The source repo was designed for Symfony 2 framework, so credit should be given where credit due!"
